      {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980059
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 replace battery (unlimited prototype supply)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980060
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980061
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect test marker"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980062
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect motel guest ledger"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980063
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect faded corridor photograph"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980064
    m_Localized: Language settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980065
    m_Localized: "[1] English\n[2] \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0439"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980066
    m_Localized: 'Selected: {0}

      F1: close'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980067
    m_Localized: English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980068
    m_Localized: "\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0439"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964095021056
    m_Localized: Current registration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907136
    m_Localized: 'CLERK: "The bureau booked one night?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907137
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "One for now."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907138
    m_Localized: 'CLERK: "Sign here. If you need another, tell me before noon."


      [You
      sign the current registration line. A room key is provided.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907139
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Can I visit the radio station tonight?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907140
    m_Localized: 'CLERK: "Try in the morning. I wouldn''t count on anyone answering
      the door now."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907141
    m_Localized: "MOTEL \u2014 Reception"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907142
    m_Localized: "MOTEL \u2014 Your guest room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907143
    m_Localized: "MOTEL \u2014 Guest corridor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907144
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 TEST: replace battery (does not turn radio ON)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907145
    m_Localized: ON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907146
    m_Localized: OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907147
    m_Localized: '[Movement in the corridor.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907148
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Someone''s still up."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907149
    m_Localized: A man in the corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907150
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Do you work here?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907151
    m_Localized: 'MAN: "Nights."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907152
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''m here about the missing presenter from the local
      station."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907153
    m_Localized: 'MAN: "Their program''s on now."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907154
    m_Localized: Your portable receiver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907155
    m_Localized: Your receiver is OFF beside your belongings. E at the receiver takes
      it; inspecting the bag does not. You can go into the corridor without it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101440
    m_Localized: '[You take the receiver. It remains OFF.]

      Left Shift controls
      power once carried. E at your bag reviews its program while ON.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101441
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Let''s hear which program he means."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101442
    m_Localized: Left Shift turns your carried receiver ON. Then use E at the bag
      to review the program. The cyan test stand replaces an empty battery without
      switching ON.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101443
    m_Localized: 'ANNOUNCER: "Good evening. A reminder that tomorrow''s community
      notices must reach the station before midday. We''ll be back after the music."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101444
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''ll ask him what he meant."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101445
    m_Localized: The corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101446
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Gone."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101447
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''ll ask at the desk in the morning."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101448
    m_Localized: 'PROTOTYPE: First-night trial complete. Morning inquiry is not included
      yet.

      This is a development notice, not dialogue. Esc closes; D finishes.
      You may look around and return to the room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101449
    m_Localized: Current registration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101450
    m_Localized: Finish the current check-in before using your room. This grants
      no access to historical guest records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101451
    m_Localized: Check in at the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101452
    m_Localized: Find your room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101453
    m_Localized: See who's in the corridor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101454
    m_Localized: Speak to the man, if someone is there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101455
    m_Localized: Fetch your receiver from the room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101456
    m_Localized: Check the station on your receiver.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101457
    m_Localized: Ask the man about the program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101458
    m_Localized: First-night trial complete. You may return to the room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101459
    m_Localized: left with belongings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101460
    m_Localized: carried
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101461
    m_Localized: 'A/D: walk   E: interact   Receiver: {0}, {1} ({2}%)

      Left
      Shift: power when carried   Reading: A/D, Esc close   F1: language'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101462
    m_Localized: "WORKING v02 \u2014 text-only program/movement. No new art/audio
      integration."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101463
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 current registration / clerk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101464
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 enter your room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101465
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 take the receiver"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101466
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect bag / review your receiver"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101467
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 go into the corridor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101468
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 return to your room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101469
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 speak to the man"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101470
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 look around the empty corridor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371565367296
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Your envelope arrived?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281856
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "The assignment did. The payment didn''t."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281857
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Accounts have it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281858
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "They had it last week."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281859
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "I''ve put an advance on this one."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281860
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "What''s the story?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281861
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Local radio presenter. Reported missing. A reader sent
      us the cutting."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281862
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Why us?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281863
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "They wrote to three papers. We answered."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281864
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "What have you checked?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281865
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Enough to send someone. The rest is your job."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281866
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Travel?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281867
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Return fare. One night at the motel. The booking''s in
      the envelope."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281868
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "And if it takes longer?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281869
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Call me when you have something."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281870
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''ll call when I know something."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281871
    m_Localized: 'EDITOR: "Fine. Keep the receipts."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281872
    m_Localized: 'Assignment: [TOWN_NAME]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281873
    m_Localized: 'A presenter at [STATION_NAME] has been reported missing.


      A
      reader asks why the station has made no announcement about a replacement. This
      has not been independently verified.


      Establish the presenter''s last
      confirmed movements. Speak to the station and seek corroboration outside it.


      Expenses
      authorized: return fare and one night at [MOTEL_NAME]. Booking enclosed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281874
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "No announcement isn''t proof of anything. Start with
      the people who worked with them."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281875
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "They kept the headline. Cut my name."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281876
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Take this. See what their station sounds like when
      I get there."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281877
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''d better read what they''re paying for."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281878
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Check in. Find out when the station opens."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281879
    m_Localized: Answer the telephone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281880
    m_Localized: Review the assignment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281881
    m_Localized: Take your things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281882
    m_Localized: Leave for [TOWN_NAME].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281883
    m_Localized: Leave for the assignment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281884
    m_Localized: Published cutting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281885
    m_Localized: Telephone conversation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281886
    m_Localized: Portable receiver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 264371628281887
    m_Localized: A working portable receiver.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
